---
description: Do not add Cursor credit to commits or pull requests
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commits and pull requests

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or any Cursor co-author trailer) to commit messages.
- Never add "Made with Cursor" or similar attribution in PR titles, bodies, or commit messages.
- Keep commit and PR text attributed only to the human author unless they ask otherwise.
